WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:02.350
Well, let's get crackin'.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.580
Let's-a-go.

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:05.920
Stop messing around and start!

00:01:31.330 --> 00:01:33.960
Tomorrow's the start of a long break...

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:36.130
Don't forget that you're all students...

00:01:36.130 --> 00:01:38.090
...and act with caution.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:39.590
Yes, ma'am!

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:41.630
Students feel restless around this time of year...

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:45.510
...and many cause societal disturbances.

00:01:45.510 --> 00:01:48.470
I am terribly concerned.

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:51.480
Take extreme care to avoid causing any trouble.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:54.020
In short...

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:55.020
If ya do something bad...

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:57.280
...it'll cut into my vacation...

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:59.150
...so I'm begging ya!

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:00.860
Sh-She's hopeless...

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:06.760
It's finally vacation...

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:10.160
When I think about how I won't
have to see your face every day...

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:11.290
...I feel so good.

00:02:11.290 --> 00:02:12.710
Sis...

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:15.540
Well, even if it is a vacation...

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:19.150
...I'll still see Teacher every day.

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:20.010
Why?

00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:21.220
Do you have make-up classes or something?

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:24.140
We're in the same party on an MMO.

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:25.550
That's just yeah.

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:26.600
MMO?

00:02:26.600 --> 00:02:29.100
She plays a wizard, and I'm a tank.

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:30.600
So if we pair up and I pull...

00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:32.600
...we can get crazy experience.

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:34.100
Uh...

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:36.480
Well, I'm the only one who's actually busy.

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:40.280
All Teacher has to do is click AOE spells.

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:43.280
The other day, I pulled this huge mob...

00:02:43.280 --> 00:02:45.110
...but Teacher had fallen asleep...

00:02:45.110 --> 00:02:47.740
It took a whole day to make up
the experience lost from death.

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:49.120
Um...

00:02:49.120 --> 00:02:51.660
In Japanese, okay?

00:02:53.830 --> 00:02:55.580
Good morning.

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:58.000
It sure is hot this morning.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:02:59.420
Morning.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:00.630
Your hair's pretty wild.

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:02.220
Hey, Sis.

00:03:02.220 --> 00:03:03.470
How about we turn on the A/C?

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:04.970
There you go again...

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:07.180
Don't be so quick to depend on that stuff.

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:09.310
Just use a fan or something.

00:03:09.310 --> 00:03:10.260
Here.

00:03:11.930 --> 00:03:14.480
A fan can make it pretty cool.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:15.650
Right?

00:03:16.850 --> 00:03:18.370
I'm hot...

00:03:19.150 --> 00:03:21.150
You get tired from fanning yourself...

00:03:21.150 --> 00:03:23.320
...and once you stop, you feel
even hotter than before, right?

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:24.520
When you use a fan...

00:03:25.820 --> 00:03:27.450
Well, I expected this.

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:29.120
Hang in there.

00:03:31.990 --> 00:03:34.620
Everybody's wearing yukatas.

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:39.500
Well, our sashes are the pre-tied kind.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.090
The ones you can just attach.

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:44.340
Even then, yukatas sure are hard to put on.

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:47.220
Yours is a real tied-on sash, huh?

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.890
Guess I shouldn't be surprised.

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:49.600
No.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.770
A clerk at the store tied it for me.

00:03:52.770 --> 00:03:56.520
Tying a sash would be too difficult for me.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:57.850
I see.

00:03:58.150 --> 00:04:00.230
And Konata's wearing one.

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:01.440
Oddly enough.

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:04.440
Did you get also yours tied at the store?

00:04:04.440 --> 00:04:05.150
Nope.

00:04:05.150 --> 00:04:07.390
My dad did it for me.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:10.070
Oh, really...

00:04:10.070 --> 00:04:12.010
Come on, let's go!

00:04:14.160 --> 00:04:16.960
<i>How come her dad knows how to tie a sash?</i>

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:20.080
Hey!

00:04:20.080 --> 00:04:21.170
Konata-chan!

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:22.960
A cop?

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:24.300
Do you know her?

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:26.590
She's Cousin Yui.

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.010
Nice ta meet ya!

00:04:28.800 --> 00:04:28.840
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:29.590
Hi.

00:04:29.590 --> 00:04:30.850
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:32.970
Listen to your elders...

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.180
...and control yourself...

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:36.930
...and get home early.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:39.310
<i>No, no, no, no, no.</i>

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:41.150
<i>We're in the same year.</i>

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:42.940
<i>Don't use Konata as the standard.</i>

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:44.940
We're all in the same year.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:46.190
Whoa!

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:47.530
Sorry, sorry.

00:04:47.530 --> 00:04:48.990
I'm amazed!

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:51.200
The difference in size got me.

00:04:52.030 --> 00:04:52.740
That's okay.

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:53.910
Man...

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:57.660
Girls sure hit puberty early these days.

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:58.160
<i>No.</i>

00:04:58.160 --> 00:04:58.920
<i>Like I said!</i>

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:00.630
<i>Don't use Konata as the standard!</i>

00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.540
<i>We're the normal ones!</i>

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:05.050
It's a shooting game.

00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:06.210
Cousin Yui.

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:08.520
Aren't you good at shooting games?

00:05:10.890 --> 00:05:12.220
Believe it or not...

00:05:12.220 --> 00:05:15.260
...I'm good enough to be
known as Sharpshooter Yui-chan.

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:17.420
I can hit five bullseyes in three seconds.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.810
With enough time to flash a peace sign.

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:23.310
Then show us.

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:24.140
Here.

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:24.820
Huh?

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:26.030
What?

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:27.530
You use rifles for shooting games?

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:28.360
What a surprise!

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:31.530
I use pistols.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.870
Can't wait! Can't wait!

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:44.000
Narumi.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.800
What are you so concentrated on over there?

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:46.960
Aren't you on duty?

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:47.090
What?

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:49.170
Okay, back to patrolling.

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:52.470
Let's try this again...

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:53.760
Hey, big guy.

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:57.600
We can have anything over there if we hit it?

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:00.100
They're all okay.

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:02.440
All of them?

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:07.820
Whoa, miss.

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:09.690
I'm not a prize.

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:13.160
Summer festivals are all about shaved ice!

00:06:13.160 --> 00:06:14.200
It's pretty hot.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:15.280
Let's have some.

00:06:15.370 --> 00:06:16.030
Oh, yeah.

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:18.330
I've been wondering...

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:21.910
I know what strawberry, lemon, and melon are...

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:24.500
...but what kind of fruit is a Blue Hawaii?

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:25.540
What does it taste like?

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:31.130
L-Like Blue Hawaii?

00:06:31.130 --> 00:06:32.380
<i>That's right..</i>

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.260
<i>That's what you would think.</i>

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:36.550
So Miyuki-san...

00:06:36.550 --> 00:06:38.930
Do you know anything about Blue Hawaii?

00:06:39.600 --> 00:06:41.180
<i>Blue Hawaii, is it?</i>

00:06:41.180 --> 00:06:43.240
<i>Um, let's see...</i>

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:44.900
<i>Is it a song?</i>

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:46.110
<i>B-Blue...</i>

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.150
<i>No, that's not it.</i>

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:50.320
I'm not really sure.

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:52.650
I'm sorry I couldn't be of any help.

00:06:52.650 --> 00:06:54.570
I'll look it up in the near future.

00:06:55.110 --> 00:06:56.660
I'm counting on you.

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:57.910
I don't believe there are any fruits
or confections by that name.

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:58.530
<i>Wait.</i>

00:06:58.530 --> 00:06:59.950
<i>Shouldn't the person who wants to know...</i>

00:06:59.950 --> 00:07:02.830
<i>...be looking it up instead of Miyuki?</i>
I don't believe there are any fruits
or confections by that name.

00:07:02.830 --> 00:07:04.000
Um...

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:07.080
About Blue Hawaii...

00:07:07.340 --> 00:07:08.960
I think the name comes from...

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:12.260
...a cocktail with the same name and color.

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:17.140
The cocktail was named with
the movie <i>Blue Hawaii </i>in mind.

00:07:17.300 --> 00:07:19.060
You're right.

00:07:19.060 --> 00:07:20.590
That was very informative.

00:07:22.430 --> 00:07:24.060
<i>When you learn something from Tsukasa...</i>

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:27.690
<i>...it feels like you've really failed.</i>

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:31.320
I just realized that I barely have any money left.

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:34.030
Stuff at these stalls isn't cheap.

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:36.240
Use your money wisely.

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:37.280
For crying out loud...

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:44.120
But the whole festival atmosphere
makes you wanna spend.

00:07:44.120 --> 00:07:45.210
I guess.

00:07:45.210 --> 00:07:49.920
It's like how you don't realize how
expensive doujinshi is when you're at Comiket.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:51.880
Afterwards, you're like, "Whoa, I spent a lot."

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:54.920
<i>Seriously, nobody else understands your world!</i>

00:07:54.920 --> 00:07:57.220
You're all exhausted from
waiting in line since morning...

00:07:57.220 --> 00:07:59.760
...and it's really far between
the west gate and east gate.

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:01.930
<i>We don't know what you're talking about.</i>

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:06.100
I love how cotton candy is all fluffy and sweet!

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:08.770
You're not a child.

00:08:08.770 --> 00:08:10.640
Eat slower.

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:16.660
It's not as entertaining when two girls do it.

00:08:17.150 --> 00:08:18.350
Don't say it.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:22.200
Why haven't any of us found any romance?

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.120
Summer means festivals which means yukatas!

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:26.460
If this was a dating sim...

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:29.040
...you'd probably trigger at least one flag somewhere.

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:30.080
Flag?

00:08:30.080 --> 00:08:32.250
And there'd be an event scene.

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:33.000
Since you'd be in yukatas.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.170
And it's outdoors.

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:36.090
Okay, that's far enough.

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:38.760
Aren't you going to play anything, Kagami-san?

00:08:39.840 --> 00:08:41.430
Since we're here...

00:08:41.470 --> 00:08:43.810
Might as well scoop goldfish or something.

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:50.480
I haven't even made a move!

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:51.690
Why are they running away?

00:08:51.940 --> 00:08:55.780
Didn't they sense your barbaric nature and run away?

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:58.820
Guess we've finally got some hard proof.

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:02.910
Look!

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.680
There's one right here!

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.120
You're right.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:07.410
Okay...

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.960
Gotta catch 'em all!

00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:11.710
Yay!

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:13.590
I caught one!

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:14.630
That was amazing!

00:09:17.420 --> 00:09:19.010
<i>I'll take care of it.</i>

00:09:19.630 --> 00:09:21.970
<i>I'll take good care of it.</i>

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:23.390
<i>Lil' Goldy.</i>

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:26.180
Yo.

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:27.770
Y'all came together.

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:30.270
I heard there was a festival around here...

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:32.560
...so I figured I might as well come.

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:34.150
I love festivals.

00:09:34.440 --> 00:09:37.400
Did you come with your boyfriend?

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:39.360
'Course not.

00:09:39.360 --> 00:09:41.030
Ain't got one.

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:45.450
<i>There really isn't a shred of romance around us.</i>

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:47.080
<i>Figured as much.</i>

00:09:47.450 --> 00:09:48.660
We meet again!

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:51.220
Looks like you're having fun with a new friend.

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:52.580
Hello.

00:09:57.420 --> 00:10:00.170
So this is the one who really hit puberty early, huh?

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:01.930
She's our teacher.

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:02.890
For homeroom.

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:04.050
I'm terribly sorry.

00:10:04.050 --> 00:10:06.890
I assumed that you were a classmate.

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.140
It's okay.

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.980
This is Cousin Yui.

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:11.100
She's a cop.

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:12.190
As you can see.

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:13.600
Yeah...

00:10:13.600 --> 00:10:15.360
Today's a summer festival...

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:17.570
...so I'm on patrol here.

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:20.320
Man, they make us work in such hot weather.

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:21.700
<i>Work?</i>

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:23.320
<i>Looks like you're just having fun.</i>

00:10:23.740 --> 00:10:26.160
Are you also working?

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:27.450
Keeping an eye on students?

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:28.410
Nah.

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.370
I was bored so I figured I'd drop by.

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:31.580
Lucky you.

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:32.830
If I wasn't on duty...

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:35.840
...I would have come to play around.

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:37.210
<i>No.</i>

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:39.920
<i>You're having plenty of fun as it is!</i>

00:10:41.050 --> 00:10:43.090
Are you also by yourself?

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:45.120
Yes, I am.

00:10:45.740 --> 00:10:47.100
I see!

00:10:58.980 --> 00:11:01.570
Actually, I would recommend Balsamic vinegar...

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:04.320
But the normal vinegar you
may have in your kitchen works fine.

00:11:04.320 --> 00:11:10.720
<i>Balsamic vinegar.</i>

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:16.210
Vacations are kind of boring
since you usually have nothing to do.

00:11:16.210 --> 00:11:18.250
You get used to sitting around and doing nothing.

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:21.170
If you're going to say that...

00:11:21.170 --> 00:11:24.470
...don't ask me to show you my homework later.

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:27.760
I see.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:31.310
It sure is cute.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:33.680
All stout and rotund.

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:36.400
And how the outside looks like a froggie.

00:11:37.810 --> 00:11:38.940
Yep, yep.

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:42.860
Depleted uranium, huh?

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:43.990
That's cool!

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:49.450
I'll get in trouble if I'm on the phone too long.

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:52.640
Then bye!

00:11:54.830 --> 00:11:56.460
I was on the phone with Kona-chan...

00:11:56.460 --> 00:12:00.010
...and I mentioned how much
free time we have during vacation...

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:05.630
...but she's playing a bunch of games
that have piled up so she has no free time.

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:10.050
I guess some people still enjoy a
full and satisfying summer vacation.

00:12:10.050 --> 00:12:12.310
Maybe I should do something, too.

00:12:12.560 --> 00:12:13.060
<i>Well...</i>

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:15.230
<i>I suppose that's okay...</i>

00:12:15.230 --> 00:12:18.150
<i>But do your homework!</i>

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:19.020
<i>Honestly...</i>

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:20.610
<i>Every single time...</i>

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:24.480
I'll pull one.

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:31.780
Debuff please.

00:12:35.620 --> 00:12:36.960
Teacher logged on.

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:45.970
You're on a lot more since it's vacation, huh?

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:50.340
I've got some time. Wanna go hunting?

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:52.720
I'm in the cave near Chopron Village.

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:57.520
Then I'll be waiting by the gate.

00:13:16.870 --> 00:13:18.040
<i>Teacher...</i>

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:23.040
<i>Stop talking about the real world on an MMO every day...</i>

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:27.970
It's like I'm getting yelled at by Kagami every day.

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:30.760
Yo!

00:13:30.760 --> 00:13:32.390
Sure is hot today.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:33.890
Welcome.

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:34.930
Come on in.

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:36.240
Hello.

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:41.560
You set up an electric fan.

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:43.520
Since it's hot.

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:45.070
Cool yourself down.

00:13:51.450 --> 00:13:52.740
I knew it.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.700
I knew you'd do it.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:56.120
Good morning.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:57.910
Kona-chan's here.

00:13:57.910 --> 00:13:58.790
Yo.

00:13:58.790 --> 00:14:00.540
Good morning, my foot!

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:02.580
Do you have any idea what time it is?

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:07.580
It sure is hot.

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:11.630
You too?!

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:13.260
Well, it's the normal thing to do.

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:14.700
It isn't.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.220
But Kagami also did it this morning.

00:14:17.720 --> 00:14:18.640
See.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:20.850
<i>I was seen.</i>

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:24.060
Looks like Comp Festival's pretty popular.

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:25.190
What's that?

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:29.940
If you collect the forms that come in
these magazines and send them in...

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:33.240
...you can get every single limited edition QUO card.

00:14:34.780 --> 00:14:39.240
I'm constantly taking magazines
to the register like I'm possessed.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:42.870
You were saying the same thing
about QUO cards the other day.

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:47.040
Japanese people are really weak when it
comes to special gifts or limited edition stuff.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:51.920
That's why it's essential to buy one for
preservation, one to look at, and one extra.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:52.670
Wait!

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:55.090
You're undeniably a special case!

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:56.890
There aren't many people like you.

00:14:56.890 --> 00:15:00.640
Sometimes, I forget who I lent it to
and have to buy another one.

00:15:00.640 --> 00:15:01.730
Don't forget.

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:02.520
So...

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:05.350
I'd like to order the usual...

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:06.560
Homework!

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:07.730
Again?

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:10.190
I'll teach you the stuff you don't know...

00:15:10.190 --> 00:15:12.320
...so try doing the problems yourself.

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:15.490
Balsamic vinegar.

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.160
Kagami.

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:19.540
Tell me how to do this one.

00:15:20.740 --> 00:15:21.620
For this one...

00:15:26.130 --> 00:15:27.170
Kagami.

00:15:27.170 --> 00:15:29.390
I don't know how to do here through here.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:33.930
That was close.

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:36.050
Kagami.

00:15:36.050 --> 00:15:36.220
This one is...

00:15:36.220 --> 00:15:38.140
You're not even trying to think it through, are you?!

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:44.180
I am thinking it through.

00:15:44.180 --> 00:15:45.480
Really...

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:48.480
And I don't know any of the ones past this one.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:50.010
You aren't thinking after all!

00:15:51.980 --> 00:15:54.130
She ended up not telling me how to do them.

00:15:54.860 --> 00:15:55.860
Hey!

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:57.110
I'm here to play!

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:58.490
Cousin Yui.

00:15:58.490 --> 00:15:59.490
Perfect timing.

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:02.330
Teach me this part.

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.710
Math homework?

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:05.410
Let's see.

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:06.420
Leave it to me.

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:08.920
Well...

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:11.510
I must say, as a good police officer...

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:13.960
...my help would not be to your benefit...

00:16:13.960 --> 00:16:15.510
...so don't depend on others!

00:16:24.100 --> 00:16:26.770
It's such a pain when I don't
understand any of the questions...

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:28.980
If you don't know the answer...

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:31.650
...just write something that sounds close.

00:16:32.610 --> 00:16:35.240
Because you just have to turn the homework in.

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:36.570
I get it.

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:37.650
You're smart!

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:42.410
<i>But this really weakens what she said before...</i>

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:45.080
<i>I doubt this will be to my benefit...</i>

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:45.700
Yeah...

00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:47.410
That's what I did!

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.370
I'm exhausted...

00:16:51.460 --> 00:16:54.920
I'll do a little gaming for a break.

00:16:57.220 --> 00:17:00.300
I'll do some solo hunting for thirty minutes.

00:17:00.300 --> 00:17:02.160
Thirty minutes should be okay.

00:17:06.140 --> 00:17:09.810
Solo hunting, right? Right?

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:16.490
...becomes fiction.

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:21.950
...what make you strong.

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:23.330
This isn't...

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:25.790
...else.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:33.710
A rare drop.

00:17:35.130 --> 00:17:36.510
Laevateinn!

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:38.670
I've never seen anyone with this!

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:40.050
It's ultra rare!

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:43.600
Found a Laeva sword!

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:00.670
Okay. Come on!

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:04.570
Well, where should we try it out?

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:07.040
Everybody's pumped up.

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:07.540
That's right.

00:18:07.540 --> 00:18:11.080
I'll buy a bunch of quality potions to pass out.

00:18:11.750 --> 00:18:14.040
Let's go back to town first...

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:16.920
Gonna get busy!

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.350
Good lucky!

00:18:25.500 --> 00:18:27.970
I'm your navigator, Akira Kogami!

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:31.350
We're already on the fifth episode of Lucky Channel!

00:18:31.350 --> 00:18:34.690
Let's get even crazier!

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:37.070
Now let me introduce...

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:40.990
...someone who's showing up more
often in the actual show and getting full of it...

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:42.780
I mean...

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.490
The hardworking...

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.660
Minoru Shiraishi-san!

00:18:46.660 --> 00:18:47.580
Clap. Clap. Clap.

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:48.450
Well...

00:18:48.450 --> 00:18:50.700
I didn't mean to look like I was full of it...

00:18:51.200 --> 00:18:53.830
I'm the assistant, Minoru Shiraishi.

00:18:53.830 --> 00:18:55.380
It's a pleasure!

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:56.380
Okay.

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:59.710
We're always receiving lots of postcards.

00:18:59.710 --> 00:19:03.470
Today's is from U.S.S. Gatoh in Tokyo.

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:05.680
Occupation: NEET.

00:19:05.680 --> 00:19:08.010
This guy sent in fifty by himself...

00:19:08.010 --> 00:19:10.690
He must be one sorry guy!

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:12.850
Let's move on to the postcard.

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:15.850
Good day, Akira-san and Minoru-san.

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:19.610
In the actual show, Konata-chan seems to play MMOs.

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:23.080
Do you also play these games, Akira-san?

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:28.990
By the way, I live a happy life
playing female characters every day.

00:19:31.450 --> 00:19:32.790
MMOs?

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:34.460
Online games?

00:19:34.460 --> 00:19:37.040
I'm sorry to say that I've never tried it.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.960
But it's better if you haven't.

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:41.920
<i>Another blunt response...</i>

00:19:43.170 --> 00:19:45.220
R-Really?

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:49.850
Too many people getting addicted
and giving up on the real world.

00:19:49.850 --> 00:19:52.220
I was dumb like that once.

00:19:52.220 --> 00:19:53.980
I would log on whenever I had time...

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:57.720
...and stay on forever doing stuff like PKKing.

00:19:58.140 --> 00:19:59.940
Back when I was young.

00:19:59.940 --> 00:20:01.780
Wh-When you were young...?

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:02.730
Er.

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:06.110
There were a bunch of words I didn't get...

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:08.740
You're better off not knowing.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:12.830
Well, only half the audience is going to get it anyway.

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:16.080
A-Anyway, so you've played them before?

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:20.170
Then do you have any online
experiences you would like to share?

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:21.130
Yep!

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:22.840
You bet I do!

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:25.300
When l first started...

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:26.630
...I didn't know what to do...

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:30.970
...and I got lots of help from
some really nice and experienced guys!

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:35.350
They gave me lots of
expensive armor and rare items!

00:20:35.350 --> 00:20:37.480
Akira was so touched!

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:40.020
R-Really...

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:43.690
It was really fun so you should all play, too!

00:20:44.610 --> 00:20:46.650
We're already out of time.

00:20:46.650 --> 00:20:48.570
Bye-bee!

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:50.360
Then we'll see you next time.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:54.580
So you're popular in those kind of games, huh?

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:56.200
Huh?

00:20:57.300 --> 00:20:58.040
Akira-sama?

00:20:58.740 --> 00:20:59.710
What's wrong?

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:02.250
Cut 12 on page 38.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:02.860
Yes?

00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:05.700
Who the hell is Yutaka?!

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:06.550
That's what you're mad about this time?!

00:21:06.550 --> 00:21:08.380
I'm Akira!

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:08.760
Well, that's true...

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:10.340
Bring out whoever's responsible!

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:10.890
No! Uh...

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:11.720
D-Director?

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:12.300
Director?!

00:21:12.300 --> 00:21:12.970
Ah, no.

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:13.600
The hell is Yutaka?!
A producer would be better.

00:21:13.600 --> 00:21:14.510
Producer would be better!
The hell is Yutaka?!

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:14.890
Hey!

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:15.770
A-Akira-san!

00:21:15.770 --> 00:21:17.120
Please calm down!

00:21:17.120 --> 00:21:17.430
Please!

00:21:17.430 --> 00:21:18.690
You know.

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:19.020
Yes?

00:21:19.020 --> 00:21:21.150
Why don't we change Minoru Shiraishi's name...

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.110
...to something else?

00:21:23.110 --> 00:21:24.020
Like Su-

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:28.490
You rocked, Kagamin!

00:21:28.490 --> 00:21:29.950
Cut that out.

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:32.530
So is Tsukasa or Miyuki next?

00:21:32.530 --> 00:21:33.240
Me.

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:34.200
Again?!

00:21:34.200 --> 00:21:35.620
When did you order a song?!

00:21:35.620 --> 00:21:38.960
They were taking too long and it'd be a waste of time.

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:39.830
Sorry.

00:21:39.830 --> 00:21:41.750
I need a little more time to decide.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:42.630
I'm sorry.

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:44.460
It's okay.

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:47.130
We can kill some time with Konata's singing.

00:21:50.880 --> 00:21:51.890
I know this!

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:54.760
Didn't expect you to go with something mainstream.

00:21:55.180 --> 00:21:56.520
Kami rules!

00:21:56.520 --> 00:21:57.770
Sparking!

00:22:57.350 --> 00:22:59.040
Well, next time on Lucky Star:

00:22:59.260 --> 00:23:00.580
I'm Konata.

00:23:00.790 --> 00:23:03.000
When you first start MH2...

00:23:03.330 --> 00:23:07.710
...the condition for learning weapons is defeating five Gearnos.

00:23:07.710 --> 00:23:09.060
So once you return to town...

00:23:09.060 --> 00:23:11.380
...and get sent on a quest by the elder...

00:23:11.380 --> 00:23:13.760
...even if you defeat five Gearnos...

00:23:13.760 --> 00:23:15.930
...get loads of snow mountain grass...

00:23:15.930 --> 00:23:17.890
...and lots of poponotan...

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:19.640
...when you can't go back to town...

00:23:19.640 --> 00:23:23.600
...you realize for the first time that you
can't access your supply box yourself...

00:23:23.600 --> 00:23:27.690
...and your reward is decreased since
you didn't read the instruction manual...

00:23:27.690 --> 00:23:29.570
...and you can't save up money.

00:23:29.570 --> 00:23:33.520
Doesn't it make you wonder about
how this applies to the real world?

00:23:33.900 --> 00:23:34.860
Next time:

00:23:34.860 --> 00:23:36.230
Summer Events!

00:23:36.900 --> 00:23:38.260
Look forward to next time!
